title: "Ground-state uniqueness on convex domains and sharp logarithmic concavity on balls"
authors:
  - family-names: Zweiman
    given-names: Henry
date-released: 2026-09-16
version: 1.2.0
url: "https://github.com/Hwzw/algebra-number-theory-drafts/tree/main/papers/P46-logarithmic-ball-concavity"
abstract: "Uniqueness of the positive logarithmic Schrodinger ground state on every bounded convex domain follows from a Gaussian-strength logarithmic Hessian bound and a sharp energy inequality with rigidity. The manuscript retains sharp concavity on balls and convex-deformation ground-state counterexamples. AI-assisted preprint, not independently verified."
